{
 "brief": "Lina al-Tawil, director of the Palestinian Prisoner Support Center, warned of a severe and escalating crisis in Israeli detention facilities, Shehab Wire reported. She described prisoners facing systematic torture and organized starvation across multiple prisons and detention centers operated by Israeli authorities.\n\nAl-Tawil's warning underscores deteriorating conditions that she said require immediate intervention. The rights director called for urgent action and international accountability to address the treatment of detainees held in Israeli facilities.",
